# Playwright (always on)

Read and follow `.cursor/skills/playwright/SKILL.md` in this repo for every task.

**Required whenever you touch:**
- `frontend/e2e/**`, `playwright.config.*`, or Playwright helpers
- User-facing flows (auth, booking, calendar, spaces, checkout, forms)

**Non-negotiables:**
- Role-based locators first (`getByRole`, `getByLabel`, `getByText`); avoid `page.locator`
- Use `getByTestId` only when `data-testid` exists or roles are insufficient
- Fixtures, `beforeEach`/`afterEach`, web-first `expect` assertions; no hardcoded timeouts
- DRY helpers in `e2e/helpers/` with JSDoc; config in `playwright.config.*` only
- Stable parallel-safe tests; critical paths only; no comments in generated test code

**UI changes:** add accessible names (labels, button text, headings) so e2e tests need no brittle selectors.

**After test or flow changes:** run the narrowest Playwright scope that covers the change.

Full standards: `.cursor/skills/playwright/SKILL.md` · Examples: `.cursor/skills/playwright/examples.md`
